# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  .env.local.example  –  Local development overrides template
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#  SETUP: copy this file to .env.local and edit values as needed.
#
#    cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
#  • .env.local is loaded ON TOP of .env by run_local.sh.
#  • Variables set here OVERRIDE matching values from .env.
#  • .env.local is git-ignored – your live secrets are never affected.
#  • Leave a line commented out to inherit the value from .env.
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


# ── Flask core ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Use a simple local secret – different from your live key so sessions
# created locally never collide with production sessions.
FLASK_SECRET_KEY=local-dev-secret-change-me-please
FLASK_DEBUG=1


# ── OpenAI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for AI resume features. Can be the same key as live,
# or a separate dev key to track usage separately.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...


# ── Stripe ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Use Stripe TEST mode keys locally so no real charges happen.
# Get test keys from https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys
# Leave blank to disable Stripe entirely for local preview.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...


# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local OAuth testing, you need a separate OAuth client configured
# with redirect URI: http://127.0.0.1:5001/google/callback
# or disable Google login for local testing by leaving these blank.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=


# ── Facebook OAuth ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Same as Google – needs a test app or leave blank to disable.
# FACEBOOK_APP_ID=
# FACEBOOK_APP_SECRET=


# ── Email / SMTP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to disable email sending locally (newsletters, alerts).
# Or point at a local MailHog / Mailtrap instance for safe testing.
# SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# NEWSLETTER_EMAIL=
# NEWSLETTER_PASSWORD=


# ── Azure Storage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to use local JSON files instead of Azure Table Storage.
# The app gracefully falls back to local file storage automatically.
# AZURE_STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING=
# AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT=


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  DO NOT set WEBSITE_HOSTNAME or WEBSITE_INSTANCE_ID here.
#  run_local.sh explicitly unsets them to keep the app in local mode.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
